{"id":164,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"国際と安全を軸に学ぶ附属池田中","feature_description":"大阪教育大学附属池田中学校は、「国際」「安全」をキーワードに中等普通教育を実施し、探究学習と学校安全を両立する学校です。公式サイトでは、SPS認証校としての安全な環境づくりと、生徒の活動や研究活動の紹介が確認でき、学びの幅広さが伝わります。 さらに、SPS認証校として学校安全を継続的に磨き、安心して学べる環境づくりを進めています。","clubs":[{"id":3577,"name":"陸上競技部（男女）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3578,"name":"野球部（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3579,"name":"卓球部（男女）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3580,"name":"バスケットボール部（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3581,"name":"バレーボール部（女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3582,"name":"テニス部（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3583,"name":"テニス部（女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3584,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3585,"name":"ボッチャ部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3586,"name":"ＩＥＥ部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3587,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3588,"name":"自然科学部","cat